### POST Requests
POST {{baseURL}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "rfidUid": "1145419415",
    "firstName": "Audrey France",
    "lastName": "Villaflor",
    "universityId": "2025-1134415",
    "universityEmail": "villaflorad@students.nu-cebu.edu.ph",
    "contactNumber": null,
    "profilePicture": null,
    "emergencyContactNumber": null
}

### POST with a profile picture (multipart). Uploaded to S3 under nusis/
POST {{baseURL}}/api/students
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=NusisBoundary

--NusisBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="rfidUid"

1234567890
--NusisBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="firstName"

Juan
--NusisBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="lastName"

Dela Cruz
--NusisBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="universityId"

2025-0000001
--NusisBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="universityEmail"

delacruzj@students.nu-cebu.edu.ph
--NusisBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="profilePicture"; filename="profile.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./profile.jpg
--NusisBoundary--

### Card tap: the first tap of a visit records Time In, the next records Time Out
POST {{baseURL}}/api/daily-logs/tap
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "rfidUid": "3906277695"
}

### PUT Requests
# Replaces a student's profile picture (the old file is deleted from S3)
PUT {{baseURL}}/api/students/2/profile-picture
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=NusisBoundary

--NusisBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="profilePicture"; filename="profile.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./profile.jpg
--NusisBoundary--
